Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 04:11:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Normalize dashboard history and honor P2 event
 invalidation

Stage one of card E live CPU follow-up: immutable keyed history rows avoid repeated column scans; trusted P2 changes invalidate in-place event edits while bookkeeping-only rows reuse events. Full diagnostics remain fresh. Proof: two ingestion/bookkeeping regressions RED then GREEN; event edit/replacement and heartbeat cases RED on original source; 73 focused tests passed. This is not full budget acceptance; history reductions and scale/replay/live P1 remain.
---
